  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Spinna**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Left Behind**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Don't Tell Me**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Dig**: back after 61 archived shows (936 days) [2]\n- **Hold On**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **California Love**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Spinna**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Spinna**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2005-12-08akg391.flac16f** (recommended): source not stated; 90 songs; 141 min [1]. Said about its sound: Uploader finds the vocals quiet relative to the instruments, and this is noticeable on the recording [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Reggie [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2005-12-08akg391.flac16f**: taped by W Clark; transferred by W Clark; source: AKG 391 > UA-5 (bm2) > JB3 [1]. Also: Track breakdown for this recording was supplied by a person known as baltman, correcting the uploader's original text file; Taped with AKG 391 microphones; the file is FLAC at 16-bit, and a security helper watched the gear [1]",
